{
    "version": "0.5.0",
    "description": "高级 Web 路径扫描与暴力破解工具",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/maurosoria/dirsearch",
    "license": "GPL-2.0-only",
    "suggest": {
        "python": "uv"
    },
    "url": "https://github.com/maurosoria/dirsearch/archive/refs/tags/v0.5.0.zip#/dirsearch.zip",
    "hash": "eb0913c964c37674095dda07d85bab65bc36e35fdc9716cc4b8aff691e75af5e",
    "extract_dir": "dirsearch-0.5.0",
    "pre_install": [
        "Set-Content \"$dir\\dirsearch.bat\" '@pushd %~dp0",
        "@uv run python \"dirsearch.py\" %*",
        "@popd' -Encoding Ascii"
    ],
    "post_install": [
        "uv venv \"$dir\\.venv\"",
        "uv pip install -r $dir\\requirements.txt --python \"$dir\\.venv\\Scripts\\python.exe\""
    ],
    "bin": "dirsearch.bat",
    "checkver": "github",
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/maurosoria/dirsearch/archive/refs/tags/v$version.zip#/dirsearch.zip",
        "extract_dir": "dirsearch-$version"
    },
    "notes": [
        "【工具类型】: Web 安全测试工具",
        "【主要功能】: 对 Web 服务器进行路径/目录暴力扫描，发现隐藏资源",
        "【适用场景】: 渗透测试、Web 漏洞挖掘前的信息收集阶段",
        "【技术特点】: 基于 Python 3.11+ 开发，需 uv 管理的虚拟环境运行",
        "【注意事项】: 使用前请确保已安装 uv；首次运行会自动创建 .venv 并安装依赖"
    ]
}

